{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_190_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_190","textTraditional":"一、九年，春，叔弓會楚子於陳。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_190_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_190","textTraditional":"二、許遷於夷。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_190_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_190","textTraditional":"三、夏，四月，陳火。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_190_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_190","textTraditional":"國曰災，邑曰火。火不志，此何以志？閔陳而存之也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_190_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_190","textTraditional":"四、秋，仲孫貜如齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_190_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_190","textTraditional":"五、冬，築郎囿。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}